{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-09-10-dubai-2008-vs-2026-record-prices-falling-rents-massive-suppl-4fdefd4cca:u000016"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Recovery, expansion, hyper supply, recession, one full cycle, seven to nine years for Dubai.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-10-dubai-2008-vs-2026-record-prices-falling-rents-massive-suppl-4fdefd4cca:u000016"}], "text": "The Dubai property market follows a cycle of phases: recovery, expansion, hyper supply, and recession, which together form a complete cycle that lasts seven to nine years."}, "title": "Dubai Property Market Phases", "topic": "Dubai property market"}, "content_hash": "a8cf6b1a46a4a7cecdc3a5d90b3347a6fdc5af61b611f57ae3b9df294b89f0cc", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-09-10-dubai-2008-vs-2026-record-prices-falling-rents-massive-suppl-4fdefd4cca:knowledge:3aaae9522ab8409c", "metadata_hash": "8758500e93e2df20b93ba954ce70d0178856d8ff077bc4720ed2d9c8443e435c", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-09-10", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "c6de24aaad820ae56f1951829b3c28b60645b017ca33168bc15ef4f0fe5e2610", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-10-dubai-2008-vs-2026-record-prices-falling-rents-massive-suppl-4fdefd4cca", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fpjQdsJSLCM", "title": "Dubai Property Market Phases", "topic": "Dubai property market", "topic_slug": "dubai-property-market"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-09-10-dubai-2008-vs-2026-record-prices-falling-rents-massive-suppl-4fdefd4cca:u000012"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "That's not an explanation. That boom ran on borrowed money. Ninety percent financing. Flippers...The market was not standing on demand. It was standing on credit.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-10-dubai-2008-vs-2026-record-prices-falling-rents-massive-suppl-4fdefd4cca:u000012"}], "text": "The 2008 property crash in Dubai was a credit crash fueled by leverage, where the market relied on credit rather than demand, eventually leading to a halt in buyers when credit froze."}, "title": "Explaining 2008 Crash", "topic": "Dubai property market"}, "content_hash": "a8cf6b1a46a4a7cecdc3a5d90b3347a6fdc5af61b611f57ae3b9df294b89f0cc", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-09-10-dubai-2008-vs-2026-record-prices-falling-rents-massive-suppl-4fdefd4cca:knowledge:14eae804da3ab0fb", "metadata_hash": "8758500e93e2df20b93ba954ce70d0178856d8ff077bc4720ed2d9c8443e435c", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-09-10", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "c6de24aaad820ae56f1951829b3c28b60645b017ca33168bc15ef4f0fe5e2610", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-10-dubai-2008-vs-2026-record-prices-falling-rents-massive-suppl-4fdefd4cca", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fpjQdsJSLCM", "title": "Explaining 2008 Crash", "topic": "Dubai property market", "topic_slug": "dubai-property-market"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-09-10-dubai-2008-vs-2026-record-prices-falling-rents-massive-suppl-4fdefd4cca:u000018"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Recovery began late 2021 with...Villas jumped 21% in a year. Then expansion. 2025 closed with more than 215,000 residential sales.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-10-dubai-2008-vs-2026-record-prices-falling-rents-massive-suppl-4fdefd4cca:u000018"}], "text": "Since late 2021, the Dubai property market experienced a recovery with a 21% villa price jump followed by expansion with a significant increase in residential sales closing out 2025."}, "title": "Current Market Insight", "topic": "Dubai property market"}, "content_hash": "a8cf6b1a46a4a7cecdc3a5d90b3347a6fdc5af61b611f57ae3b9df294b89f0cc", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-09-10-dubai-2008-vs-2026-record-prices-falling-rents-massive-suppl-4fdefd4cca:knowledge:256b3d81912801ac", "metadata_hash": "8758500e93e2df20b93ba954ce70d0178856d8ff077bc4720ed2d9c8443e435c", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-09-10", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "c6de24aaad820ae56f1951829b3c28b60645b017ca33168bc15ef4f0fe5e2610", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-10-dubai-2008-vs-2026-record-prices-falling-rents-massive-suppl-4fdefd4cca", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fpjQdsJSLCM", "title": "Current Market Insight", "topic": "Dubai property market", "topic_slug": "dubai-property-market"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-09-10-dubai-2008-vs-2026-record-prices-falling-rents-massive-suppl-4fdefd4cca:u000037"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "The person who bought a villa in a supply constrained community and the person who bought one of four hundred identical apartments both sit inside the same rising line and they have completely different lives.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-10-dubai-2008-vs-2026-record-prices-falling-rents-massive-suppl-4fdefd4cca:u000037"}], "text": "Even if the market line indicates an upward trend, the returns can differ significantly for properties in supply constrained communities versus those that are part of a large, uniform apartment complex."}, "title": "Property Market Differentiation", "topic": "Dubai property market"}, "content_hash": "a8cf6b1a46a4a7cecdc3a5d90b3347a6fdc5af61b611f57ae3b9df294b89f0cc", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-09-10-dubai-2008-vs-2026-record-prices-falling-rents-massive-suppl-4fdefd4cca:knowledge:2482841350f03c0b", "metadata_hash": "8758500e93e2df20b93ba954ce70d0178856d8ff077bc4720ed2d9c8443e435c", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-09-10", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "c6de24aaad820ae56f1951829b3c28b60645b017ca33168bc15ef4f0fe5e2610", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-10-dubai-2008-vs-2026-record-prices-falling-rents-massive-suppl-4fdefd4cca", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fpjQdsJSLCM", "title": "Property Market Differentiation", "topic": "Dubai property market", "topic_slug": "dubai-property-market"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-09-10-dubai-2008-vs-2026-record-prices-falling-rents-massive-suppl-4fdefd4cca:u000017"], "form": "structure", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "Recovery, expansion, hyper supply, recession, one full cycle, seven to nine years for Dubai. It's not chaos. It's a machine with the rhythm.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-10-dubai-2008-vs-2026-record-prices-falling-rents-massive-suppl-4fdefd4cca:u000017"}], "text": "The explanation of the Dubai property market cycle is sequenced into four explicit phases: recovery, expansion, hyper supply, and recession, followed by an assertion about its predictability and duration."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": "1", "title": "Market Cycle Explanation", "topic": "Dubai property market"}, "content_hash": "a8cf6b1a46a4a7cecdc3a5d90b3347a6fdc5af61b611f57ae3b9df294b89f0cc", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-09-10-dubai-2008-vs-2026-record-prices-falling-rents-massive-suppl-4fdefd4cca:expression:28b20cf3b3e17462", "metadata_hash": "8758500e93e2df20b93ba954ce70d0178856d8ff077bc4720ed2d9c8443e435c", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-09-10", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "c6de24aaad820ae56f1951829b3c28b60645b017ca33168bc15ef4f0fe5e2610", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-10-dubai-2008-vs-2026-record-prices-falling-rents-massive-suppl-4fdefd4cca", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fpjQdsJSLCM", "title": "Market Cycle Explanation", "topic": "Dubai property market", "topic_slug": "dubai-property-market"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-09-10-dubai-2008-vs-2026-record-prices-falling-rents-massive-suppl-4fdefd4cca:u000012"], "form": "tone", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "Most people explain 2008 with the three words: the financial crisis...That's not an explanation. That boom ran on borrowed money.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-10-dubai-2008-vs-2026-record-prices-falling-rents-massive-suppl-4fdefd4cca:u000012"}], "text": "The speaker uses historical explanation and critique of common misconceptions about the 2008 crash to provide clarity and correct understanding among viewers."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": "1", "title": "Use of Historical Explanation", "topic": "Dubai property market"}, "content_hash": "a8cf6b1a46a4a7cecdc3a5d90b3347a6fdc5af61b611f57ae3b9df294b89f0cc", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-09-10-dubai-2008-vs-2026-record-prices-falling-rents-massive-suppl-4fdefd4cca:expression:8b58ce0839e18a14", "metadata_hash": "8758500e93e2df20b93ba954ce70d0178856d8ff077bc4720ed2d9c8443e435c", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-09-10", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "c6de24aaad820ae56f1951829b3c28b60645b017ca33168bc15ef4f0fe5e2610", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-10-dubai-2008-vs-2026-record-prices-falling-rents-massive-suppl-4fdefd4cca", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fpjQdsJSLCM", "title": "Use of Historical Explanation", "topic": "Dubai property market", "topic_slug": "dubai-property-market"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-09-10-dubai-2008-vs-2026-record-prices-falling-rents-massive-suppl-4fdefd4cca:u000001"], "form": "rhetorical_move", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "Are you early? Are you someone else's exit liquidity.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-10-dubai-2008-vs-2026-record-prices-falling-rents-massive-suppl-4fdefd4cca:u000001"}], "text": "The speaker uses rhetorical questions to engage the audience and provoke self-reflection about their position in the current market situation."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": "1", "title": "Rhetorical Question Usage", "topic": "Dubai property market"}, "content_hash": "a8cf6b1a46a4a7cecdc3a5d90b3347a6fdc5af61b611f57ae3b9df294b89f0cc", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-09-10-dubai-2008-vs-2026-record-prices-falling-rents-massive-suppl-4fdefd4cca:expression:f419cd9abae51998", "metadata_hash": "8758500e93e2df20b93ba954ce70d0178856d8ff077bc4720ed2d9c8443e435c", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-09-10", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "c6de24aaad820ae56f1951829b3c28b60645b017ca33168bc15ef4f0fe5e2610", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-10-dubai-2008-vs-2026-record-prices-falling-rents-massive-suppl-4fdefd4cca", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fpjQdsJSLCM", "title": "Rhetorical Question Usage", "topic": "Dubai property market", "topic_slug": "dubai-property-market"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-09-10-dubai-2008-vs-2026-record-prices-falling-rents-massive-suppl-4fdefd4cca:u000036"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Over supply is really a city problem. It's a building problem.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-10-dubai-2008-vs-2026-record-prices-falling-rents-massive-suppl-4fdefd4cca:u000036"}], "text": "Over supply is really a city problem. It's a building problem."}, "title": "Impact of Oversupply", "topic": "property market analysis"}, "content_hash": "a8cf6b1a46a4a7cecdc3a5d90b3347a6fdc5af61b611f57ae3b9df294b89f0cc", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-09-10-dubai-2008-vs-2026-record-prices-falling-rents-massive-suppl-4fdefd4cca:knowledge:da8c2dfbcc71b0db", "metadata_hash": "8758500e93e2df20b93ba954ce70d0178856d8ff077bc4720ed2d9c8443e435c", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-09-10", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "c6de24aaad820ae56f1951829b3c28b60645b017ca33168bc15ef4f0fe5e2610", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-10-dubai-2008-vs-2026-record-prices-falling-rents-massive-suppl-4fdefd4cca", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fpjQdsJSLCM", "title": "Impact of Oversupply", "topic": "property market analysis", "topic_slug": "property-market-analysis"}
